      <h1 id="virt-eviction-strategies" class="group scroll-mt-20">Configure eviction and run strategies<a href="#virt-eviction-strategies" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p class="_abstract">You can configure eviction strategies for virtual machines (VMs) or for the cluster. The default eviction strategy is <code>LiveMigrate</code>, which ensures that a virtual machine instance (VMI) is not interrupted if the node is placed into maintenance or drained.</p>
      <p><strong>Cluster eviction strategies</strong></p>
