      <p>Example cluster eviction strategy:</p>
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: hco.kubevirt.io/v1beta1\nkind: HyperConverged\nmetadata:\n  name: kubevirt-hyperconverged\nspec:\n  evictionStrategy: LiveMigrate\n# ..."} lang="yaml" />
      </li>
