      <h2 id="virt-runstrategies-vms_virt-eviction-strategies" class="group scroll-mt-20">Run strategies<a href="#virt-runstrategies-vms_virt-eviction-strategies" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">The <code>spec.runStrategy</code> key determines how a VM behaves under certain conditions. This key has four possible values: <code>Always</code>, <code>RerunOnFailure</code>, <code>Manual</code>, and <code>Halted</code>.</p>
