      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>RerunOnFailure</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>The VMI is re-created on another node if the previous instance fails. The instance is not re-created if the VM stops successfully, such as when it is shut down.</p>
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
        <AlertTitle>Important</AlertTitle>
        <AlertDescription>
